      rdfs:label "Snyk"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/nis2onto-ops#SoftwareApplication
:SoftwareApplication rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf :SoftwareAsset ;
                     rdfs:comment "Software that is intended for end-user use."@en ;
